<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil posts profit in October.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil posts profit in October.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal bank Banco do Brasil posted a net profit in October of 34.812 million reais, or 0.05 reais per 1,000-share lot, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank said the October result brought its profit for the second half of 1996 so far to 158.788 million reais.</p>
<p>Banco do Brasil posted Brazil's largest-ever commercial bank loss in first-half 1996 by plunging 7.8 billion reais into the red after posting a 4.2 billion real loss in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
